  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline O-TORO OCTA is the newest evolution of the O-TORO family, designed by former ATP Top-25 professional and Toroline Chief String Officer Steve Johnson. Built from the same core formula as O-TORO TOUR, OCTA changes the extrusion to an eight-sided profile. This reduces mechanical ball grip slightly, lowers launch angle and creates a cleaner, more direct response with greater court penetration and faster ball speed. Its Tour-level flex emphasizes control, stability and durability, making it particularly suitable for advanced players who like O-TORO TOUR but want a more penetrating trajectory and purer response.",

    "zh": "Toroline O-TORO OCTA 是 O-TORO 系列最新的进阶版本，由前 ATP 世界前25球员、Toroline Chief String Officer Steve Johnson 设计。它使用与 O-TORO TOUR 相同的核心配方，但将截面改为八边形。这样的变化会略微降低球线对网球的机械抓球，却带来更低的 Launch Angle、更强 Court Penetration、更快 Ball Speed，以及更加纯粹、直接的击球反馈。Tour 级偏硬 Flex 进一步强化控制、稳定和耐久，非常适合喜欢 O-TORO TOUR，但希望球路更低、更快、更具穿透力的高级和比赛型球员。"
  },

